LWPR (optional, NOT bundled)                                              LGPL
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The LWPR baseline calls `pylwpr`, a Python binding over the LWPR C++ library by
S. Vijayakumar and S. Klanke (University of Edinburgh), distributed under the
LGPL with linking exceptions. It is not redistributed here; build it from the
upstream Edinburgh distribution to reproduce the LWPR rows. Every other method
runs without it. See:

    S. Vijayakumar, A. D'Souza, S. Schaal, "Incremental Online Learning in High
    Dimensions", Neural Computation 17(12), 2005.

